{"text":"tell at everything I did. But I would very quickly learn that in acting school, things weren't that straightforward. Acting is not like math, where there is only one correct answer to the problem, and once you've figured out the formula, you're all set. In acting, like in life, sometimes coming up with the wrong answer to the problem is the best way to figure out the formula for yourself. In acting school, you are expected to fail and fail publicly a lot. It is the constant exposure to failure that frees you from the strongholds of the ego and allows you to embrace vulnerability. And it is in embracing vulnerability that you can surprise yourself in performance and share something really special about human nature. I'll give you an example. Imagine now that you've been singled out from this crowd, just as you are. You're told that your goal is to make everybody laugh.","words":[{"text":"tell","start":0.0,"end":0.22},{"text":"at","start":0.22,"end":0.44},{"text":"everything","start":0.44,"end":0.9},{"text":"I","start":0.9,"end":1.28},{"text":"did","start":1.28,"end":1.58,"punct":"."},{"text":"But","start":2.0,"end":2.22},{"text":"I","start":2.22,"end":3.04},{"text":"would","start":3.04,"end":3.22},{"text":"very","start":3.22,"end":3.52},{"text":"quickly","start":3.52,"end":3.84},{"text":"learn","start":3.84,"end":4.18},{"text":"that","start":4.18,"end":4.4},{"text":"in","start":4.4,"end":4.54},{"text":"acting","start":4.54,"end":4.9},{"text":"school","start":4.9,"end":5.36,"punct":","},{"text":"things","start":5.78,"end":6.12},{"text":"weren't","start":6.12,"end":6.4},{"text":"that","start":6.4,"end":6.62},{"text":"straightforward","start":6.62,"end":7.12,"punct":"."},{"text":"Acting","start":8.1,"end":8.28},{"text":"is","start":8.28,"end":8.48},{"text":"not","start":8.48,"end":8.64},{"text":"like","start":8.64,"end":8.86},{"text":"math","start":8.86,"end":9.24,"punct":","},{"text":"where","start":9.74,"end":10.2},{"text":"there","start":10.2,"end":10.46},{"